<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug crude, natural gas output rise.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug crude, natural gas output rise.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 105.21 million tonnes of crude oil in the first eight months, a rise of 6.63 percent from the same period in 1995, the State Statistical Bureau said in a report issued on Monday.</p>
<p>Output in August alone was 13.31 million tonnes.</p>
<p>Natural gas output totalled 13.13 billion cubic metres in the first eight months of the year, up 15.50 percent from the year-ago period, it said.</p>
<p>Gas production in August alone was 1.57 billion cubic metres.</p>
</text>
